+# Phase 03 continuation — labels and responsive acceptance
+
+Implemented presentation-only unit labels, owner action roles, payroll declaration evidence modes and register status/hash fallback copy, plus the existing named/focusable scroll-region option on the inventory table. Preserved server-owned values, action authority and custom source text. Changed five production files plus focused tests; captured pre-edit contents in Delivery 09's baseline.
+
+108 mocked tests, semantic TypeScript for 23 production roots and scoped ESLint passed (one existing inventory image warning). Reconciliation populated successfully under SUPER ADMIN and fit a measured 390×844 phone viewport. Tablet testing exposed a dev compiled-page/cache error; a separate dev cache restored owner checks. Owner and declaration labels, owner/declaration/inventory tablet/phone containment, and navigation/row-menu Escape/focus return were verified.
+
+Detailed changed-file manifest, command review, browser context, remaining role gaps and rollback: [Delivery 09](../../docs/system-audit/2026-10-12-ui-ux-review/roadmap/EXECUTION-09.md). Read the final acceptance notes there for subsequent checks.
+
+Next: finish Phase 03 role and responsive acceptance using connected owner/accountant/cashier sessions; then proceed to the next scoped roadmap package. This slice does not certify all roles, all states, actual screen readers, deployed performance or the complete phase. No transaction submission, migration, seed, build or deployment was performed. Ordinary read guards can audit navigation.
